uveHD, blepszy35, gostek37, prismatic.fractal.official, Wojobart |\n| <img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/brazil.png\" width=\"24\" alt=\"Português (Brasil)\" /> | **Português (Brasil)** | Mikeliro, Tutis64, yurilegal523, jo123654, renan2nd, caacneto |\n| <img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/portugal.png\" width=\"24\" alt=\"Português (Portugal)\" /> | **Português (Portugal)** | casperskyloard137 |\n| <img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/romania.png\" width=\"24\" alt=\"Română (România)\" /> | **Română (România)** | ARBlueSlime |\n| <img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/russia.png\" width=\"24\" alt=\"Русский (Russkiy)\" /> | **Русский (Russkiy)** | Wildkiri, Rushan, ropigiop, zarlomaika, Slonic |\n| <img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/turkey.png\" width=\"24\" alt=\"Türkçe (Türkiye)\" /> | **Türkçe (Türkiye)** | ygzbys, kamilgicikkapanoglu |\n| <img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/ukraine.png\" width=\"24\" alt=\"Українська (Ukrayins'ka)\" /> | **Українська (Ukrayins'ka)** | Envy, romanmelnichenko |\n| <img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/vietnam.png\" width=\"24\" alt=\"Tiếng Việt (Việt Nam)\" /> | **Tiếng Việt (Việt Nam)** | ngnamkhanh160106, baooduy |\n| <img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/china.png\" width=\"24\" alt=\"简体中文（中国大陆）\" /> | **简体中文（中国大陆）** | tyan929589864, yezhiyi9670, Shadow23333 |\n| <img src=\"https://cdn.moddinglegacy.com/flags/pixel/taiwan.png\" width=\"24\" alt=\"繁體中文（台灣）\" /> | **繁體中文（台灣）** | Cheung2015 |\n\n<hr />\n<br>\n\n<span><strong>🤚 支持：如果您对我们的模组有任何疑问或遇到问题，请查阅常见问题解答！您也可以 <a href=\"https://gitlab.com/groups/modding-legacy/-/issues\">在问题追踪器上提交反馈</a>，或加入我们的 Discord 服务器，我们将竭诚为您提供帮助！</strong></span>\n<br><br>\n\n<center>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/6ZFAbzj\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/223938153260515328/widget.png?style=banner3\" alt=\"Modding Legacy Discord Server\" /></a>\n</center>\n<br>",
